   <text type="letter">
      <body>
         <div type="writingSession">
            <pb n="1"/>
            <opener>
               Columbia University<lb/>
               in the City of <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York</rs><lb/>THE REVIEW OF RELIGION<lb/>
               <dateline>401 Low Memorial Library<lb/> <date when="1940-05-15">May 22nd, 1940</date></dateline>
               <lb/><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Professor
                 Paul Tillich</rs>
               <lb/>Union Theological Seminary
               <lb/> <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York City</rs>
               <salute>My dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Professor
                  Tillich</rs>:</salute>
            </opener>
            <p>I am afraid it is quite impossible for us to drop the review of <rs
                  ref="#tillich_person_id__1783" type="person">Siegfried</rs>&apos;s book entirely.
               When publishers send us books for review, and expensive books at that, they naturally
               expect a review to be forthcoming. And when we accept a book we obligate ourselves to
               print a review of it. We are entirely dependent upon the good will of publishers for
               books, otherwise it would be impossible for us to have a Book Review section at all.
               It is a matter of honor with us to make good to the publishers in this matter, and we
               rely on the people who accept books for review to co-operate with us. I regret to
               note that this is the third book which we have sent to you for which we have received
               no review. Won't you please make an effort to send us a review of this book before
               August fifteenth?</p>
            <closer>
               <salute>Sincerely yours,</salute>
               <signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__4051" type="person"
                  ><hi rend="hand">(Mrs.) Marguerite Block</hi></rs><lb/>Secretary</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
